    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Prepare to embark on a thrilling adventure as the mischievous Lightbearers invade your tranquil home, reshaping it with their enigmatic technology! It's time to rally your courage, rescue your friends, and send those bears packing in this action-packed platformer that's perfect for the entire family! <br><br>Immerse yourself in a visually captivating world with retro-inspired graphics that'll transport you to a bygone era of gaming nostalgia. Get ready for an epic quest filled with excitement and endless fun! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/14d47edf27f8ee7b755407227874bd21.poster.avif?t=1723618216\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/14d47edf27f8ee7b755407227874bd21.webm?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/14d47edf27f8ee7b755407227874bd21.mp4?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Unleash your inner sorcerer as you engage in whimsical yet engaging combat. Wield a wide array of magical powers to thwart the Lightbearers, and get ready to grin from ear to ear as you unleash your creative arsenal of enchanting weaponry!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/d9b9bfd61452889fb7f32252b79527ac.poster.avif?t=1723618216\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/d9b9bfd61452889fb7f32252b79527ac.webm?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/d9b9bfd61452889fb7f32252b79527ac.mp4?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Embark on a dazzling journey through a tapestry of vibrant and diverse landscapes, from enchanting forests to mysterious caves, sun-kissed beaches, and beyond! Each level is a new adventure waiting to be explored! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/0f717db36e45a3b557d5645e5326e80b.poster.avif?t=1723618216\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/0f717db36e45a3b557d5645e5326e80b.webm?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/0f717db36e45a3b557d5645e5326e80b.mp4?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience classic action/platforming gameplay across a multitude of mesmerizing biomes.<br></li><li>Take on fun bosses, ranging from imposing tanks to the legendary Kraken!<br></li><li>Harness the power of magical wands, including fire, lightning, and even love, throughout your epic adventure.<br></li><li>Discover new weapons and unlock exciting features as you traverse the enchanting lands of Penni's Adventure!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Prepare to embark on a thrilling adventure as the mischievous Lightbearers invade your tranquil home, reshaping it with their enigmatic technology! It's time to rally your courage, rescue your friends, and send those bears packing in this action-packed platformer that's perfect for the entire family! <br><br>Immerse yourself in a visually captivating world with retro-inspired graphics that'll transport you to a bygone era of gaming nostalgia. Get ready for an epic quest filled with excitement and endless fun! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/14d47edf27f8ee7b755407227874bd21.poster.avif?t=1723618216\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/14d47edf27f8ee7b755407227874bd21.webm?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/14d47edf27f8ee7b755407227874bd21.mp4?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Unleash your inner sorcerer as you engage in whimsical yet engaging combat. Wield a wide array of magical powers to thwart the Lightbearers, and get ready to grin from ear to ear as you unleash your creative arsenal of enchanting weaponry!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/d9b9bfd61452889fb7f32252b79527ac.poster.avif?t=1723618216\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/d9b9bfd61452889fb7f32252b79527ac.webm?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/d9b9bfd61452889fb7f32252b79527ac.mp4?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Embark on a dazzling journey through a tapestry of vibrant and diverse landscapes, from enchanting forests to mysterious caves, sun-kissed beaches, and beyond! Each level is a new adventure waiting to be explored! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/0f717db36e45a3b557d5645e5326e80b.poster.avif?t=1723618216\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/0f717db36e45a3b557d5645e5326e80b.webm?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479020/extras/0f717db36e45a3b557d5645e5326e80b.mp4?t=1723618216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience classic action/platforming gameplay across a multitude of mesmerizing biomes.<br></li><li>Take on fun bosses, ranging from imposing tanks to the legendary Kraken!<br></li><li>Harness the power of magical wands, including fire, lightning, and even love, throughout your epic adventure.<br></li><li>Discover new weapons and unlock exciting features as you traverse the enchanting lands of Penni's Adventure!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Lightbearers have invaded, altering your world with technology! Save friends and send bears packing in this family-friendly action platformer!",
